  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s World Banking Expanding Financial Inclusion for Women in Southeast Asia &amp; Core Funds 2023-28</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s World Banking (WWB) is a leading global organisation on women&apos;s financial inclusion, working with financial service providers and policy makers to give low-income women increased access and capability to use financial tools and resources - thus increasing their agency and economic empowerment. This investment will provide both core (global) funding and funding specific to work in Southeast Asia (Indonesia, Vietnam and Cambodia) which follows on from earlier work under WWB Southeast Asia engagement strategy. WWB focuses on 1) understanding women&#x2019;s needs, behaviours and preferences; 2) developing and scaling financial products; 3) strengthening institutions and leadership to better meet women&#x2019;s needs; and 4) advocating for women&#x2019;s financial inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
